review:
Good game. Suitable for senior citizens like me.

From what I have played so far, the positive points are:
1. Very tolerant of selection for people with impaired hands;
2. Visually pleasing;
3. Slow introduction to a computer topic;
4. Good feedback on results of HTML formatting.

The only negative point is that I cannot have the required HTML result page and current HTML result page open at the same time.
